<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 58.6 MLN RAND OF SAFRICAN BONDS MON.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 58.6 MLN RAND OF SAFRICAN BONDS MON.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 58.59 million rand worth of South African bonds on Monday after buying a net 120.35 millionrand on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
